{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1308940/extras/Banner12.png?t=1748024907\" /> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Meet <strong>Buddy</strong> and <strong>Bag Boy</strong> - two tiny robots with big hearts and an even bigger mission: spreading joy wherever they go! After a mysterious explosion rains golden cogs and trash from the sky, the duo must work together to restore each village and uncover the secret behind the blast.<br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1308940/extras/HeScrubsHeCleans.png?t=1748024907\" />Scrub messes, collect trash, and lend a helping hand by cleaning up. Every difference you make earns you points. Got trash? Recycle it at any RECYC0TRON for extra cash to spend in stores during your adventure.<br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1308940/extras/Cm.png?t=1748024907\" />Being this tiny has its perks too! Squeeze through tight nooks and explore a playground built from everyday objects. Dash across rulers, leap over cups, and crouch under old milk cartons. This unique perspective lets you experience the world in a whole new way.<br> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1308940/extras/Talk.png?t=1748024907\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Beneath the surface lies a touching tale that deepens as you meet new bots. From UFOs and secret lovers to unlikely heroes and dancing instruments, you\u2019ll discover a world full of quirky characters with stories worth hearing.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1308940/extras/Buddy_Plant.gif?t=1748024907\" /></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Adventure through backyards, playgrounds, and forgotten lands in a mysterious post-human world.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Clean, repair, and make a meaningful difference as you tidy each village.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Interact with unique robots made from everyday items, helping them with their struggles.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Find golden cogs, coins, and hidden treasures tucked away in every nook and cranny.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Experience a heartfelt narrative that mixes humor with real emotion.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1308940/extras/Buddy_Jump.gif?t=1748024907\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Being <i>small</i> never felt so <i><strong>BIG</strong></i></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1308940?t=1748024907","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1308940/1600bbe40c938ac7a05af790ec3d03cb9aa31229/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1748024907","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1308940/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1748024907","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1308940/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1748024907","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1308940/extras/Banner12.png?t=1748024907\" /> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Meet <strong>Buddy</strong> and <strong>Bag Boy</strong> - two tiny robots with big hearts a