m with their struggles.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Find golden cogs, coins, and hidden treasures tucked away in every nook and cranny.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Experience a heartfelt narrative that mixes humor with real emotion.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1308940/extras/Buddy_Jump.gif?t=1748024907\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Being <i>small</i> never felt so <i><strong>BIG</strong></i></p>","developers":["Tinyware Games"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1308940/3f6dedc264e9ce837c5d66d70ec4435b7768d17b/header.jpg?t=1748024907","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"\u00a9 2025 TINYWARE GAMES PTY LTD. All rights reserved.<br />\r\nMisc. A Tiny Tale is proudly supported and funded with the help of Screen Ausrtralia & Screenwest.","linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":256875706,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/256875706/movie480.mp4?t=1731597386","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/256875706/movie_max.mp4?t=1731597386"},"name":"Misc. A Tiny Tale Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/256875706/03f60d5e7abf463bc578adafc77bb5d90c2885db/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1731597386","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/256875706/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1731597386","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/256875706/movie_max_vp9.webm?t=1731597386"}}],"name":"Misc. A Tiny Tale","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS *:</strong> Windows 7<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> i5-4440 (3.10 G